  "header": "ews.northropgrumman.com Northrop Grumman Reports Fourth Quarter and Full-Year 2024 Financial Results | 16 SCHEDULE 4 NORTHROP GRUMMAN CORPORATION TOTAL BACKLOG (Unaudited) December 31, 2024 | December 31, 2023 | % Change in 2024 $ in millions | Funded 1 | Unfunded | Total Backlog 2 | Total Backlog 2",
